      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk im just so overwhelmed with work right now and i hate going to the doctor for nothing lol. it's been happening more lately every time i have a deadline. u sure it’s not just a panic attack or something? like maybe i should just try some deep breathing or herbal tea to calm down instead of making a whole thing out of it?",
